{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1181418-calling-all-dragon-blood-npc-s","id":1181418,"title":"Calling all Dragon Blood NPC's","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-02-01T09:11:45-08:00","id":1181418,"title":"Calling all Dragon Blood NPC's","content":"I am currently running a Realm civil war dragon bloods game still in the prelude phase. I am asking for any and all Realm dragon bloods that you can give me a name for. I would like fluff over crunch so personalities, motovations, intimicies, goals and fighting styles if appropriate. Thank you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1166-korekore","name":"korekore","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1166_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"141"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-01T10:08:40-08:00","id":1181428,"title":"","content":"Scroll of Exalts for 2E is a good place to start, lists quite a few DB's, several of which are Dynasts, with their backstories and crunch.<br /> <br /> Also, although all of the ones here are fanmade/non-canon I believe, it might provide some inspiration? Several have written backstories and character summaries as well as their stats.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://exalted.xi.co.nz/wiki/Characters/DragonBlooded\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://exalted.xi.co.nz/wiki/Characters/DragonBlooded\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://exalted.xi.co.nz/wiki/Characters/DragonBlooded\" target=\"_blank\"> http://exalted.xi.co.nz/wiki/Characters/DragonBlooded </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4612-solar-lantern","name":"Solar Lantern","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4612_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"77"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-01T12:29:16-08:00","id":1181466,"title":"","content":"I run loads of Dynastic games, so a while ago I put together this random generator to help me make good NPCs on the fly. I\u2019ve shared it before, but you might find it useful. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B-UuW8JycL8xT2R4N3l4b09DZEk\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B-UuW8JycL8xT2R4N3l4b09DZEk\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B-UuW8JycL8xT2R4N3l4b09DZEk\" target=\"_blank\"> https://drive.google.com/open?id=0B-UuW8JycL8xT2R4N3l4b09DZEk </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I\u2019ll also see if I can dig up some old lists of NPCs for you. I know I had over 200 Realm NPCs at one point, but I\u2019m not sure I still have the notes lying around...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5397-cytherea","name":"Cytherea","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5397_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"23"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-01T13:30:41-08:00","id":1181485,"title":"","content":"I started a list a while back in anticipation of the release of the DB book. Currently has 240 NPCs with small details and sources with page numbers.<br /> <br /> Thread: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1083055-compiling-a-list-of-canon-dynasitic-dragon-blooded\">http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/m...dragon-blooded</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/151-hark","name":"Hark","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar151_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"932"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-02-02T01:26:32-08:00","id":1181595,"title":"","content":"Never implemented him, but had an idea of a Dragon Blood who is a &quot;one-man-Wyld-Hunter/ Wyld Hunt Scout&quot; (dependant on power you give them). They beauty of them was their appearance - they appear as a 'sterotype' asian fisherman; with the large straw hat, simple trousers and boots, shirt or bare-chested (ur choice), and always with a fishing-rod.<br /> <br /> The Hat and Rod are artifacts, but the Terrestrial specializes in stealth charms to make them ignorable. Anyone who can pierieve past the 'glamor' will pick the rod is made of jade (your choice of color - black for water, green for a wooden pole) with a moonsilver string (and possibly hook as well). The hat is also jade (again your choice of color). Choose the effects of both.<br /> <br /> He is called the &quot;Fishing Prince&quot; (or Fisher King if you want), or &quot;The River Walker&quot; or whatever you will. He typically steers clear of politics, devoted more to dealing with the Anathema issue, though many times he does catch his prey (over kill) to bring back to his &quot;house&quot; (you choose which he belongs to) as prestige of his skill.<br /> <br /> His style is... unique... it &quot;may&quot; be White Reaper, and it comes in the form of him channeling essence into his Rod so that line sticks out rigid and razor sharp in a &quot;scythe curve&quot; that turns the tool into a razor-scythe with an edge impossibly small its difficult to notice - making defense harder (since the wire may wrap 'around' parries instead of slicing or rebounding off the object).<br /> <br /> His persona is one of calm smiles. He never stops. He doesn't laugh. He just smiles like he's relaxed... or smug if you're his foe. It helps him weave through crowds and walk by unnoticed. He essentially hides in plain sight. He's there... but he's almost ignorable (which is why I consider him an Air Exalt more than any other).<br /> <br /> He feels he has achieved his life's goals. This &quot;task&quot; of hunting down Exalted Terrorists is his 'retirement' plan. He assumes he will die one day doing his job, but he plans to die a hero.<br /> <br /> He may even have open discussions with his &quot;prey&quot; in advance of fighting, or even announce his intentions to them a day in advance to ask them to let their loved ones know they MAY not be seeing them again. If they run, he will pursue... but at a leisurely walk. Nothing about him suggests effort, which makes him all the more scary (how much of his power IS he REALLY holding back!!?)<br /> <br /> For extra props, he may have a Jade Pipe which can double as a flute (maybe he even smokes it WHILE playing it?) or a Black-Jade (water) Gord that provides infinate drinking wine, that is as refreshing as water but far tastier - and may even change flavors on command or at random.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Support new ideas. If you must criticize, always offer advice to the creator on how they could improve, or even suggest alternative solutions to fix a problem you can see. Dismissive comments should be equally dismissed as attempts to grab attention. Focus only on contributions that help you grow and develop, and ignore jealous efforts to stunt your creative sparks.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5915-zenvious","name":"zenvious","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}